200,118516100,46188500,49769000,35426400,59218700,32825900,52464200,32911400,27621000,38040400,29802700,16235700,8493200]}},"profile":{"website":"https://www.axis-reit.com.my","sector":"Real Estate","industry":"REIT - Diversified","employees":81,"city":"Petaling Jaya","summary":"Axis Real Estate Investment Trust (Axis-REIT), Malaysia's first real estate investment trust. Having been reclassified as an Islamic REIT on 11 December 2008, all acquisitions by Axis-REIT are Shariah compliant. It has a diverse portfolio of 70 properties strategically located in the Klang Valley, Johor, Penang, Pahang, Negeri Sembilan and Kedah as at 30 September 2026. Axis REIT Managers Berhad is the Manager of Axis REIT while RHB Trustees Berhad is the trustee of Axis-REIT. Axis-REIT has a solid industrial space portfolio. As at 30 September 2026, the occupancy rate of Axis REIT's portfolio stood at 93% with a weighted average lease expiry period of 4.3 years, based on rental. The total space under management is 15.8 million square feet and total asset value of RM5.58 billion. Axis Real Estate Investment Trust was established on June 15, 2005 and incorporated in Malaysia.","zh":"Axis Real Estate Investment Trust (Axis-REIT) 是马来西亚首个房地产投资信托，于2005年6月15日在马来西亚成立，并于2008年12月11日重新分类为伊斯兰REIT，所有收购均符合Shariah合规要求。截至2026年9月30日，其投资组合包含70处物业，战略性分布于Klang Valley、Johor、Penang、Pahang、Negeri Sembilan和Kedah，管理总面积1580万平方英尺，总资产价值55.8亿林吉特。Axis REIT Managers Berhad为管理人，RHB Trustees Berhad为受托人。","lines":["工业物业投资：租户为工业及商业租户。","伊斯兰合规房地产投资：作为伊斯兰REIT，所有收购均符合Shariah合规要求，面向符合伊斯兰教法的投资。","物业租赁与管理：管理70处战略性分布物业，截至2026年9月30日出租率93%，基于租金的加权平均租约到期期限4.3年。"],"lines_en":["Industrial property investment: Owns and leases a diversified portfolio focused on industrial space to industrial and commercial tenants.","Shariah-compliant real estate investment: As an Islamic REIT, all acquisitions are Shariah compliant, targeting Shariah-compliant investments.","Property leasing and management: Manages 70 strategically located properties with 93% occupancy and a 4.3-year weighted average lease expiry based on rental as of 30 September 2026."]}}